{"parentUuid":"3b01fbe6-a492-4dd9-bc92-fa4337d2dd75","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6c0be490-314d-4531-92ef-564b3e93bbb4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PGJaDZsS7mwPiYMKHhSDYK","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.io/gh/entireio/cli/trails/263\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n- Add `redaction.custom_secrets` so teams can define inline custom secret regexes in settings with per-key local overrides.\\n- Add `.entire/redactors/` rule packs with YAML/JSON parsing, sample validation, recursive discovery, and `.entire/redactors/local/` support for personal rules.\\n- Document the configuration surfaces, distribution guidance, troubleshooting, and security/privacy considerations.\\n\\n## Why\\nTeams have internal credential shapes and custom token prefixes that the built-in redactors cannot know about. This gives them a repo-local way to ship redaction rules without waiting for a core CLI release or a hosted marketplace.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- `mise run check`\\n- `mise run lint`\\n\\n## Notes\\n- Rule sample mismatches and invalid regexes warn but do not fail configuration loading, so one bad custom rule does not disable the rest of redaction.\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Medium Risk**\\n> Touches the core redaction pipeline and startup configuration, so bugs could cause under-redaction (secret leakage) or over-redaction in transcripts; changes are mitigated by warn-and-skip behavior and extensive tests.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> Adds user-defined secret redaction on top of existing detectors via two new configuration surfaces: inline `redaction.custom_secrets` in settings (with per-key merge/override between `settings.json` and `settings.local.json`) and YAML/JSON rule packs auto-discovered under `.entire/redactors/` (recursive, with optional `samples[]` self-tests that warn on mismatch).\\n> \\n> Wires these rules into redaction initialization (`EnsureRedactionConfigured`) and into `redact.String()` as an additional “secret” layer, updates `entire enable` to ignore `.entire/redactors/local/` via `.entire/.gitignore`, and adds docs plus comprehensive tests for settings merge, pack parsing/loading, sample validation, and logging behavior.\\n> \\n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 2a9c1022158014cb23caf30e3dc4e72369cf6367. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\".entire/.gitignore\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/settings/settings.go\",\"additions\":20,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/settings/settings_test.go\",\"additions\":72,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/strategy/common.go\",\"additions\":43,\"deletions\":17,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cmd/entire/cli/strategy/common_test.go\",\"additions\":23,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/security-and-privacy.md\",\"additions\":96,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"go.mod\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"redact/custom.go\",\"additions\":132,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"redact/custom_test.go\",\"additions\":215,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"redact/packs.go\",\"additions\":183,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"redact/packs_test.go\",\"additions\":349,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"redact/redact.go\",\"additions\":8,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefName\":\"feat/redaction-rule-extensions\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"Add user-defined redaction rules and rule packs\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3c67f1a0-dc6b-4261-8185-8feb1d7ddfd9","t